column2:
"Adversaries modify parameters used to instruct industrial control system devices. These parameters determine how and when an action is performed and may specify additional options. For example, a parameter on a control system device dictating motor processes may define the total number of seconds to run that motor. This technique cannot be easily mitigated with preventative controls since it is based on the abuse of system features."
